# 行尾策略：仓库统一 LF，Windows 脚本用 CRLF
# 目的：Windows 上不再出现 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 提示，
# 也不会因为编辑器自动改行尾而产生「整文件都变了」的假 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 原生脚本保留 CRLF（PowerShell 5.1 / cmd 的老版本对 LF 不友好）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换，也不参与文本 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.jar  binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
